  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Stir in jasmine rice, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10-15 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b22eaae8ded3386fd55985-de3b65db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Grate carrot. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook the corn and carrot until lightly browned, 4-5 mins.\n• In the last 2 mins of cooking, add Asian greens and 1/2 the soy sauce and cook, tossing, until softened and fragrant, 1-2 mins. Season to taste. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b22eaae8ded3386fd55985-26a718a8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks. In a small bowl, combine the remaining soy sauce, brown sugar, vinegar, ginger paste, sweet chilli sauce, a pinch of pepper and a splash of water.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Add sauce mixture, and cook, tossing to coat, until thickened, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b22eaae8ded3386fd55985-f1500647.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, tofu and veggie stir-fry between bowls.\n• Spoon over any glaze from pan to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b22eaae8ded3386fd55985-515e0ce5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
